cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "QPU: Quantum Processing Unit MCP Server"
abstract: "Production-ready quantum MCP server: solve any problem with unlimited network access. RSA factorization (GNFS, Shor), QAOA optimization, Cirq simulation, OpenFermion chemistry, Stim error correction. Complete CI/CD pipeline, cloud-deployable, 95 tests passing."
